    </div>

    <p class="quote-text">
        The world is full of places,<br>
        waiting to be explored. <span>Take a break from the routine,</span><br>
        and make every trip an experience <span>worth remembering.</span>
    </p>

    <div class="quote-divider">

        <span></span>

        <i class="fa-solid fa-heart"></i>

        <span></span>

    </div>

    <p class="quote-subtext">
    Discover something new,<br>
    <span>and make every journey memorable.</span>
</p>

</section>